<title>USA: Concurrent Computer in deal with Lockheed.</title>
<headline>Concurrent Computer in deal with Lockheed.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Concurrent Computer Corp said on Monday it formed an alliance with Lockheed Martin Corp to offer rugged and militarized versions of its PowerMAXION real-time computer system.</p>
<p>Under terms of the deal, Lockheed Martin Federal Systems, in Oswego, N.Y., would manufacture rugged and military versions of Concurrent's PowerMAXION.</p>
<p>Concurrent declined to comment on the value of the deal.</p>
<p>Concurrent, which provides real-time computer systems, said the deal offered it another distibution channel.</p>
</text>
